flowchart TD
  A[Confirmed Personal Events] --> B[Reflection Preview]
  B --> C{User materializes?}
  C -->|No| D[Read-only candidate preview]
  C -->|Yes| E[Proposed Memory / Intent]
  E --> F{Human review}
  F -->|Confirm Memory| G[Active Confirmed Memory]
  F -->|Activate Intent| H[Active Intent]
  F -->|Reject / defer| I[Rejected or Proposed]
  G --> J[Personal State Projector]
  H --> J
  A --> J
  J --> K[Versioned State Snapshot]
  K --> L[Authorized Agent Context]
  G --> L
  H --> L
  M[Source Purge / Evidence Revocation] --> N[Invalidate Supports]
  N --> O[Memory needs_review / Intent review_required]
  O --> L
  P[Purpose + Sensitivity + Expiry] --> L
  L --> Q[Agent Read-only]
  Q -. no writes or side effects .-> R[User approval required]